msgid "Rezystancja wewn. ra [Ω]:"
msgstr "Internal Resistance ra [Ω]:"

#: src/GUI/DialogAudioLampy.cpp:995
msgid "Moc anody max [W]:"
msgstr "Max Anode Power [W]:"

#: src/GUI/DialogAudioLampy.cpp:996
msgid "Dolna częstotliwość [Hz]:"
msgstr "Low Frequency [Hz]:"

#: src/GUI/DialogAudioLampy.cpp:1001
msgid ""
"Pola Ig2 i Ug2 wypełnij tylko dla pentody lub tetrody. μ i ra są potrzebne "
"do wzmocnienia i kondensatora katodowego (np. ECC83: μ = 100, ra = 62,5 k; "
"ECC82: μ = 17, ra = 7,7 k)."
msgstr ""
"Fill in Ig2 and Vg2 only for a pentode or tetrode. μ and ra are needed for "
"the gain and the cathode capacitor (e.g. ECC83: μ = 100, ra = 62.5 k; ECC82:"
" μ = 17, ra = 7.7 k)."

#: src/GUI/DialogAudioLampy.cpp:1014
msgid "Wpisz B+, Ra, Ia i Ug (np. 250, 100k, 0,8, -1,5)."
msgstr "Enter B+, Ra, Ia and Vg (e.g. 250, 100k, 0.8, -1.5)."

